<servcat id="06">
<name>Brake</name>
<section id="1002J_S000U" variety="S000U">
<name>Brake Control</name>
<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060A00UX" category="C" type-id="300A0" name-id="442OF-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C0273/13</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Motor Relay Circuit Open</dtcname>
<dtccode>C0274/14</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Motor Relay Circuit Short</dtcname>
<dtccode>C1361/91</dtccode>
<dtcname>Motor Fail-safe Relay Short</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060A00UX_05" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MQ00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The ABS motor relay and motor fail-safe relay are built into the actuator assembly.</ptxt>
<ptxt>If a motor system malfunction DTC is stored, the motor fail-safe relay cuts off the power supply to the ABS motor relay as a fail-safe.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The skid control computer (built into actuator assembly) turns the ABS motor relay ON to operate the pump motor in the actuator assembly while ABS, TRC, VSC or brake assist is operating.</ptxt>
<ptxt>If the voltage to the relay power source (+BM terminal) drops below the DTC detection condition due to insufficient battery or alternator output, this code may be stored.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.67in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.64in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.77in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C0273/13</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the ABS motor relay is ON during the initial check or control operation with IG1 terminal voltage at 9.5to17.2V, the ABS motor relay contact remains OFF for 0.1 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the relay is ON with IG terminal voltage below 9.5V, 0.1 seconds or more elapse without the relay contact turning ON</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ABS motor relay malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Low voltage to ABS motor relay power source (+BM)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open in wire harness</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector contact pressure, terminal deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C0274/14</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>When the ABS motor relay is OFF, the ABS motor relay contact remains ON for 4 seconds or more</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ABS motor relay internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Short in motor relay monitor circuit (inside actuator)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Short in wire harness</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1361/91</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Immediately after the IG is turned ON, when the motor fail-safe relay is OFF, the contact in the relay remains ON for 4 seconds or more</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Motor fail-safe relay internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Short in motor relay monitor circuit inside actuator</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Short in wire harness</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060A00UX_06" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MR00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146383J01" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060A00UX_07" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060A00UX_08" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000060A00UX_08_0013" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MS00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (ABS No.1 50A)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the fuse (ABS No.1 50A).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.79in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.20in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ABS No.1 Fuse</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060A00UX_08_0014" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060A00UX_08_0017" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060A00UX_08_0014" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MT00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Motor Relay Power Source System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the actuator assembly connector is properly engaged.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No malfunction</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect the actuator assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the connector case and terminals are free of deformation and corrosion.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance and voltage between the wire harness side connector of the actuator assembly and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146352J10" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.78in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.21in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1 (GND1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>13 (GND2) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.75in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.17in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.21in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>24 (+BM) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060A00UX_08_0015" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060A00UX_08_0018" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060A00UX_08_0015" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MU00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF → ON and check that the ABS warning light comes on for approximately 3 seconds and then goes off.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Drive at a vehicle speed of 6km/h or more.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>If the ABS warning light comes on, check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Malfunction Code</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>After the IG is turned ON, the skid control computer performs self-diagnosis of the motor relay circuit when a vehicle speed of 6km/h or more is input with the stop light switch OFF.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the normal code is output, lightly vibrate the connectors, wire harness and fuse of the actuator assembly and check that no malfunction code is output.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If a malfunction code is output due to vibration, inspect and repair the connector or wire harness in the relevant area.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060A00UX_08_0016" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000060A00UX_08_0019" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060A00UX_08_0016">
<testtitle>Perform Problem Reproduction Test<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060A00UX_08_0017">
<testtitle>Replace Fuse</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060A00UX_08_0018">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060A00UX_08_0019">
<testtitle>Replace ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000304V000X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
